{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-14 19:09:00', 'title': 'GENERAC CLASS ACTION: LEVI & KORSINSKY REMINDS GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. INVESTORS OF THE PENDING CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT WITH A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JANUARY 30, 2023 - GNRC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 14, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. ("GENERAC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: GNRC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF GENERAC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE EASTERN DISTRICT OF WISCONSIN. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED GENERAC HOLDINGS INC.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-14 16:00:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A LEADING INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - GNRC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 14, 2022) - \xa0WHY:\xa0ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC) BETWEEN APRIL 29, 2021 AND NOVEMBER 1, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JANUARY 30, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-14 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JANUARY 30, 2023 - (NYSE: GNRC)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC.. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF GNRC DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}